 should. The Guide states she's now the main character, and Lexion isn't the male lead! Can Tiarosetti find her way home, or will Lexion's inconsistent behavior shackle her to his world forever?","year":2023,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"69","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Isekai","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/e7314dc8-631a-4865-8ef1-95dfabcb2946/9ca8d9c7-1206-4f24-93b5-c6541d3cd6b8.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en","fr"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":7.03,"follows":913,"listAt":"2026-10-20T13:04:05.188Z","chapters":[{"id":"8ddff8f6-2cdc-41f4-b6e6-952857a3333c","number":"10","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":37,"createdAt":"2024-01-11T16:01:04+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ddc1e913-6db6-4dbd-ab86-eb0e4740f57c","number":"9","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":47,"createdAt":"2024-01-11T15:57:39+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"51555bab-825c-4e20-b696-3992b65e81f1","number":"8","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":32,"createdAt":"2024-01-11T15:55:42+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"15cc6f01-a891-44af-914d-ee333e07724e","number":"8","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":20,"createdAt":"2024-01-15T04:29:59+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"737219b8-297f-4fcb-9860-f7d0c5d69e08","number":"7","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":38,"createdAt":"2024-01-11T15:54:30+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"803381a5-e0ab-45df-9d74-48e234b943b1","number":"6","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":64,"createdAt":"2024-01-15T04:27:45+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"1371a1f8-b7bf-47ec-8e40-cf4fbeb41358","number":"6","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":44,"createdAt":"2024-01-11T13:31:48+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"4aa8a1ab-84c9-46fb-8485-55f32a34b46f","number":"5","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":43,"createdAt":"2024-01-11T11:59:06+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"5442cf39-a1e3-4190-a5bb-c713b69fd10b","number":"5","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages"